8195: #              consult_id; a rating without one by task and n); every field is read from the
8196: #              rating record itself (denormalised at -Rate time) - no join by n across tasks
8197: #   rate       w = (yes + 0.5 partly + 2p) / (n + 4p), p = 0.5 - a rate with a prior that pulls
8198: #              few ratings to 0.5; the score = 0.25 + 1.75 w, in [0.25, 2]; neutral = 1.125
8199: #   hierarchy  (lineage, purpose, topics) when the pooled topic evidence reaches 3 ratings, else
8200: #              (lineage, purpose) with >= 3, else the lineage's all-purpose rate with >= 3, else
8201: #              neutral. A rating credits each of its t topics 1/t; a request with topics pools the
8202: #              credited counts over its topics (never a mean of means)
8203: $script:RoutingWindowDays = 90
